y"],["ARC or PLC in Kossuth County","/arc-plc/iowa/kossuth-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Kossuth County has a rain record back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 162% of normal in June to July and 51% of normal in September to October. So far in 2026 the middle shows 36% of normal in January to February and 64% in May to June. Grid 27745 had its driest year in 1958 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
